              "PX041": "Inherited held source scopes plus newly confirmed incoming key07 AN/net5 white interval.",
              "PX051": "Inherited AK physical/remote source scopes; true key15/negative key14 continuity; incoming PX321BE6 versus actual PX321 BB6 reciprocal conflict kept distinct.",
              "PX061": "Inherited AK/AP physical/source qualifications plus incoming17/incoming19/negative22 continuity intervals.",
              "PX071": "AK conditional E12 and AM conditional E09 physical contacts remain null/unknown; no socket-derived repair.",
              "PX111": "BE first glyph B/E and AY final B1? contact attribution; AY physical null/unreadable with B13/AY.B13 conditional; far-right display registration qualification.",
              "PX131": "SC28 PXC31/open-zero literal attribution; reciprocal PX031 AR4 corroborates association only.",
              "PX151": "BB lower LC4/L04 literal/physical ambiguity; opaque BB.D04 preserved, physical null.",
              "PX161": "BH damaged physical first glyph and incoming erasure continuity within same original hold.",
              "PX171": "AH conditional E07 physical contact plus separate CE49 incoming PK021AQ7 continuity interval.",
              "PX181": "PXC61/PX061AH4 literal attribution remains unresolved; reciprocal key19 association alone is insufficient.",
              "PX201": "AS conditional E07 star physical contact, AY F/E location and CE46/CE51 native continuity intervals.",
              "PX211": "PXC71/PX071AS4 literal attribution plus BA/BC conditional E12/E08 physical contacts.",
